  {
   "id": 503400,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Compare and contrast the structures and mechanisms involved in both photosynthesis and cellular respiration. What cellular features and reactions are similar in both processes?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 989583,
     "content_html": "Both processes are contained in organelles with single membranes, and both use a version of the cytochrome complex."
    },
    {
     "id": 989584,
     "content_html": "Both processes are contained in organelles with double membranes, and neither uses a version of the cytochrome complex."
    },
    {
     "id": 989585,
     "content_html": "Both processes are contained in organelles with double membranes, and both use a version of the cytochrome complex."
    },
